        "text": "=Extract the following fields from this insurance denial letter and return JSON only, with no extra text or code fences.\n\nFields: claim_id, member_id, payer, service_date, cpt_code, procedure, diagnosis, billed_amount, denial_code, denial_reason, appeal_deadline_days.\n\nIf a field is missing, use null.\n\nLetter:\n{{ $json['Denial Letter Text'] }}",
